{
  "name": "@nextbot/ui",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Shared shadcn/ui component home (packages/ui/src/components/ui) + hand-authored composites (AccessDeniedState, StatusBadge), i18n primitives, realtime SSE reducer. Chakra/Emotion fully removed (Plan Phase 4, docs/plans/chakra-to-shadcn-plan.md) — every consumer (apps/web) finished its shadcn/Tailwind conversion in Plan Phase 2.",
